{"meta":{"id":"tt0117372","type":"movie","name":"Caído del Cielo","imdb_id":"tt0117372","description":"El bondadoso reverendo Henry Biggs se encuentra con que su matrimonio con la mujer del coro de su iglesia, Julia, está en peligro a causa de sus constantes ausencias para cuidar de los asuntos del vecindario a su cargo. Por si esto no fuera suficiente, su templo se encuentra amenazado a causa del promotor inmobiliario Joe Hamilton. Desesperado, el reverendo Biggs ruega a Dios que le ayude, y la ayuda acude en forma de un ángel llamado Dudley. Pero en principio Dudley aportará más complicaciones que soluciones.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt0117372.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nFt2ZMXzo9WiNCZ8cfGxaeBVEII.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qTUboKsrVnsd0jFVlEs7xMaoBFn.png","genres":["Familia","Fantasía","Drama","Comedia","Romance"],"releaseInfo":"1996","released":"1996-12-13T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"123 min","imdbRating":"5.8","country":"United States of America","cast":["Denzel Washington","Whitney Houston","Courtney B. Vance","Gregory Hines","Jenifer Lewis","Loretta Devine","Paul Bates","Justin Pierre Edmund","Lionel Richie","Victor Williams","Shari Headley","Marcella Lowery","Cissy Houston","Charlotte d'Amboise","Helmar Augustus Cooper","Jernard Burks","Aaron A. McConnaughey","Lex Monson","Darvel Davis Jr.","William James Stiggers Jr.","Shyheim Franklin","Taral Hicks","Kennan Scott","Michael Alexander Jackson","Jamie Tirelli","Lizan Mitchell","Robert Colston","Juliehera DeStefano","Delores Mitchell","David Langston Smyrl"],"director":["Penny Marshall"],"writer":["Robert Nathan","Nat Mauldin","Allan Scott","Robert E. Sherwood","Leonardo Bercovici"],"trailers":[{"source":"kYIFhk4lutY","type":"Trailer","name":"The Preacher's Wife (1996) - Movie Trailer","ytId":"kYIFhk4lutY","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"kYIFhk4lutY","title":"The Preacher's Wif